`,s.jsx(e.p,{children:"Einstein presented the Mercury result on November 18, 1915, before the November 25 presentation of the final matter field equations. Schwarzschild's solution came afterward. Those dates matter because the successful theory was still being assembled; the final formula was not sitting intact behind every earlier calculation."}),`
